andromeda: copy frames into the panel on a thread call (boot-arg andrfbasync=1)
instead of inside the vsync timer of SweetFramebuffer (ios-sweet patch 0046
and later, dipa-studio/ios-sweet; see CREDITS.md), so vsync notifications keep
their period while a frame is copied. Needs 0094, 0102, 0120 and 0201.

